message: If you use this template, please cite it as below.
title: Ontology Template
abstract: >-
  A GitHub template for realist ontologies aligned to BFO 2020 and CCO v2.0:
  pinned vendoring, a SHACL gate with falsification fixtures, an IRI linter,
  competency questions, reasoning and deterministic releases.
authors:
